    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it really does feel like a deletion. like my whole existence was just a file that got corrupted and wiped. people used to reach out every day, and now it's just silence. total silence. it's hard to justify waking up and going through the motions when the person who actually had a life is just... gone. it feels like i'm just an empty shell now.",
